{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"skeleton_bomber","model_identifier":"skeleton_bomber","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# skeleton_bomber\n\nSkeleton bomber (C1), breaker, 1.75 m = 62 u.\n\nA skeleton in a rusty kettle helmet hugging a round, iron-banded powder keg (65 cm = 23 u tall) strapped across its chest, with a short fuse and `fx_fuse` at the tip. Orange eye lights. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `jaw` and a `keg` bone (child of torso) so the keg can come loose.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.2..9.2, y 0.0..64.2, z -17.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 62 x 18 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.66 | loop |  |\n| `detonate` | 1.3 | hold | key 1.3 s (end of clip, holds): the blast. A last stagger forward hugging the keg; the game removes the unit and spawns the explosion at fx_fuse / the keg |\n| `aggro` | 1.3 | once | hefts the keg, jaw rattles |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | writhing in sunlight, keg still clutched (loop) |\n| `drop_bomb` | 2 | hold | its death: struck, the keg drops (lands 0.45 s), bounces and rolls forward and settles lying on its side at (0, 6.5, -34.4) (1.8 s) while the skeleton collapses; holds. Swap in `bomb_keg` there if the game wants a separate loose keg |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | identical copy of drop_bomb |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 32.0 u per cycle\n- `run`: 96.0 u/s (2.70 m/s), cycle 0.66 s, 63.4 u per cycle (bent forward under the weight)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `detonate`: key 1.3 s (end of clip, holds): the blast. A last stagger forward hugging the keg; the game removes the unit and spawns the explosion at fx_fuse / the keg\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 62, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 43.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 47.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (3.5, 53, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 41, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.5, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5, 32, 1.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5, 32, 1.5)\n- `fx_fuse` on `keg` at (2.5, 58.5, -11.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Breaker: its wall attack is `detonate` (played against the wall).\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n- The keg is the same geometry as `bomb_keg`.\n"},"description":"# skeleton_bomber\n\nSkeleton bomber (C1), breaker, 1.75 m = 62 u.\n\nA skeleton in a rusty kettle helmet hugging a round, iron-banded powder keg (65 cm = 23 u tall) strapped across its chest, with a short fuse and `fx_fuse` at the tip. Orange eye lights. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `jaw` and a `keg` bone (child of torso) so the keg can come loose.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.2..9.2, y 0.0..64.2, z -17.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 62 x 18 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.66 | loop |  |\n| `detonate` | 1.3 | hold | key 1.3 s (end of clip, holds): the blast. A last stagger forward hugging the keg; the game removes the unit and spawns the explosion at fx_fuse / the keg |\n| `aggro` | 1.3 | once | hefts the keg, jaw rattles |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | writhing in sunlight, keg still clutched (loop) |\n| `drop_bomb` | 2 | hold | its death: struck, the keg drops (lands 0.45 s), bounces and rolls forward and settles lying on its side at (0, 6.5, -34.4) (1.8 s) while the skeleton collapses; holds. Swap in `bomb_keg` there if the game wants a separate loose keg |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | identical copy of drop_bomb |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 32.0 u per cycle\n- `run`: 96.0 u/s (2.70 m/s), cycle 0.66 s, 63.4 u per cycle (bent forward under the weight)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `detonate`: key 1.3 s (end of clip, holds): the blast. A last stagger forward hugging the keg; the game removes the unit and spawns the explosion at fx_fuse / the keg\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 62, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 43.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 47.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (3.5, 53, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 41, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.5, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5, 32, 1.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5, 32, 1.5)\n- `fx_fuse` on `keg` at (2.5, 58.5, -11.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Breaker: its wall attack is `detonate` (played against the wall).\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n- The keg is the same geometry as `bomb_keg`.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,51.5,-1.0],"to":[1.0,54.0,1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,51.5,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[108,54,110.0,56.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[110,54,112.0,56.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[112,54,114.0,56.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[114,54,116.0,56.5],"te